      "message": "I am not very comfortable exposing this at all. We\u0027ve been trying to remove it because it\u0027s too confusing, and are almost done in fact.\n\nSo it turns out this is used by EthernetNetworkFactory only. So two things :\n• As this is used only ever in EthernetNetworkFactory, it should in fact be moved out of NetworkCapabilities.\n• EthernetNetworkFactory only ever combines the capabilities and the transport, so this method is doing the wrong thing.\n\nInstead of exposing this very internal method, please :\n• Have a new method in EthernetNetworkFactory\n  private static NetworkCapabilities mixInCapabilities(nc, addedNc) {\n    for (transport in addedNc.getTransportTypes()) nc.addTransport(transport)\n    for (capability in addedNc.getCapabilities()) nc.addCapability(capability)\n  }\n• Delete the combineCapabilities method, and all methods that are only called by that method",
